<mapreducescript scriptid="customscript_giv_mr_liquidation">
  <name>GIV Rebate Liquidation MR</name>
  <notifyadmins>F</notifyadmins>
  <scriptfile>[/SuiteScripts/giv_rebate/mapreduce/giv_mr_rebate_liquidation.js]</scriptfile>
  <scriptcustomfields>
    <scriptcustomfield scriptid="custscript_giv_mr_default_location">
      <label>Default Location</label>
      <fieldtype>SELECT</fieldtype>
      <selectrecordtype>-103</selectrecordtype>
      <ismandatory>F</ismandatory>
      <displaytype>NORMAL</displaytype>
    </scriptcustomfield>
    <scriptcustomfield scriptid="custscript_giv_mr_csv_batch_id">
      <label>CSV Batch ID</label>
      <fieldtype>TEXT</fieldtype>
      <ismandatory>F</ismandatory>
      <displaytype>NORMAL</displaytype>
      <help>Identificador del lote CSV que dispara este Map/Reduce. Cuando est&#225; presente, el script procesa &#250;nicamente los WORK records de ese lote. Vac&#237;o = procesa todos los Capturado (modo manual desde Suitelet).</help>
    </scriptcustomfield>
  </scriptcustomfields>
  <scriptdeployments>
    <scriptdeployment scriptid="customdeploy_giv_mr_liquidation">
      <title>GIV Rebate Liquidation MR</title>
      <isdeployed>T</isdeployed>
      <loglevel>DEBUG</loglevel>
      <runasrole>ADMINISTRATOR</runasrole>
      <status>TESTING</status>
    </scriptdeployment>
  </scriptdeployments>
</mapreducescript>
